<#f0f000>SPECIAL MOVES</>
CUT SPACE: DICER_EX_AIROK						_QDF^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A projectile attack.
   A Version is fast but expires quickly.
   B Version is slow, but more active. Can be feinted with D.
   C Version is fastest and 2 hits.</>
Reckless Assault_EX_AIROK							_HCB^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A flying knee with a followup that knocks down.</>
   _!Knockdown								(After any Version) ^A/^B/^C
Loiter Shot_EX								_QDB^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A series of kick attacks.
   A version is a quick, safe on block knee.
   B Version lunges across the screen at high speed. [R]
   EX is an extremely fast restand.</>
   _!Knockdown								(After A Version) ^A/^B/^C
Untamed_EX								_DSF^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A rising slash attack.
   A version is fast and launches the opponent close.
   B Version slower, 2 hits, launches further. [R]
   EX is wobbly invincible.</>

