<#f0f000>UNIVERSAL MECHANICS</>
Dead Zone_AIROK</>		^B +^C
   <#bbbbbb>A slow but powerful and large attack used for controlling space.
   Drains enemy pursuit gauge on contact.</>

Parry_AIROK</>		^D or _D _+^D
   <#bbbbbb>For 8 Frames, intercept enemy attacks and become invulnerable, 
   giving an opportunity to counterattack. Attacks must be parried high and
   low, corresponding to how they are guarded. Additionally, attacks can be
   parried in midair.</>

Backroll</>		^D (During Soft Knockdown)
   <#bbbbbb>Holding the back direction during a soft knockdown will
   allow you to back-roll. Be aware that this drains your 
   pursuit gauge.</>

Hop</>		Tap Up
   <#bbbbbb>Tapping an up direction will allow you to perform a
   small jump called a hop.</>

Retribution</>		(After Punishing An Attack)
   <#bbbbbb>After punishing a failed attack by the opponent, 
   RETRIBUTION becomes available. The first special attack with a 
   RETRIBUTION trait [R] used in the ensuing combo will perform
   a special effect, usually allowing for a 
   longer and more damaging combo.</>